ion]","stats":{"views":131,"day_views":0,"week_views":2,"month_views":6,"bookmarks_count":1,"comments_count":0,"chapters_count":62,"ratings_count":0,"reviews_count":0},"updated_at":"2026-09-09T14:34:21.000Z","cv":1788964461051,"is_new":false,"is_hot":false,"is_adult":false,"cover_censored":false,"latest_chapters":[{"id":"24L1d7w2","url":"/solo-leveling-digispirit/chapter-62-digicore","name":"Chapter 62: Digicore.","slug":"chapter-62-digicore","created_at":"2026-09-09T14:34:21.000Z","updated_at":"2026-09-09T14:34:21.000Z","number":62,"cv":1788964461051},{"id":"D6nMOqnD","url":"/solo-leveling-digispirit/chapter-61-carefree","name":"Chapter 61: Carefree","slug":"chapter-61-carefree","created_at":"2026-09-09T00:33:37.000Z","updated_at":"2026-09-09T00:33:37.000Z","number":61,"cv":1788964461051},{"id":"YJx35ev2","url":"/solo-leveling-digispirit/chapter-60-unprecedented-awakening","name":"Chapter 60: Unprecedented awakening","slug":"chapter-60-unprecedented-awakening","created_at":"2026-09-09T00:33:37.000Z","updated_at":"2026-09-09T00:33:37.000Z","number":60,"cv":1788964461051}],"genres":[{"name":"Action","slug":"action"},{"name":"Adventure","slug":"adventure"}],"is_published":true,"episode_duration":null,"has_sub":false,"anime_season":null,"ani_id":null,"year_views":131,"is_raw":false,"is_uncensored":false,"is_mtl":false,"has_dub":false,"mal_id":null,"has_dmca":false},{"id":"VYPGVxj8","url":"/mtl-king-solo","name":"MTL-King Solo","alt_names":[{"name":"王者索"}],"alt_name":"王者索","match_field":"name","slug":"mtl-king-solo","cover":"https://rs.novelbuddy.me/covers/king-solo.webp","status":"completed","rating":0,"summary":"The one who was born first is called Yu, and Yu Yu meets together. I hope that he will meet a good fate early and enjoy the glory.The one born later is called Li, and Li Tongli, I hope he can escape from calamity and suffering, and be honored and honored.Remember never to make mistakes.Otherwise, twins will share a hundred lives, one will fade and the other will grow, good and bad will depend on each other, true and false will be mixed, and there will be no good results.\" If you ask for it, you will get it, but you will not get it; one will go through hundreds of kalpas, suffer hardships, ascend to the throne, face the moon alone, you will get it if you don't ask for it, but you will not get it if you ask for it. \"Content tags: Qiang Qiang's son's sadomasochistic love affair┃ Search keywords: Protagonist: Murong Li (Li) Zhiming┃ Supporting roles: Fang Ye, Zhong Kunyi, Yu Xiaoyu Fang Ziming","stats":{"views":0,"day_views":0,"week_views":0,"month_views":0,"bookmarks_count":0,"comments_count":0,"chapters_count":3,"ratings_count":0,"reviews_count":0},"updated_at":"2026-08-16T10:40:40.000Z","cv":1786876843189,"is_new":false,"is_hot":false,"is_adult":false,"cover_censored":false,"latest_chapters":[{"id":"8AxaAWL2","url":"/mtl-king-solo/chapter-4","name":"Chapter 4","slug":"chapter-4","created_at":"2026-08-16T10:40:40.000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-16T10:40:40.000Z","number":4,"cv":1786876843189},{"id":"Ye3xAP02","url":"/mtl-king-solo/chapter-2","name":"Chapter 2","slug":"chapter-2","created_at":"2026-08-16T10:40:40.000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-16T10:40:40.000Z","number":2,"cv":1786876843189},{"id":"8GbEMWo2","url":"/mtl-king-solo/chapter-1","name":"Chapter 1","slug":"chapter-1","created_at":"2026-08-16T10:40:40.000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-16T10:40:40.000Z","number":1,"cv":1786876843189}],"is_uncensored":false,"is_raw":false,"is_mtl":true,"has_dmca":false,"is_published":true,"has_sub":false,"has_dub":false,"anime_season":null,"episode_duration":null,"mal_id":null,"ani_id":null},{"id":"j81eXeB8","url":"/mtl-kings-solo","name":"MTL-King's Solo","alt_names":[{"name":"王的独奏"}],"alt_name":"王的独奏","match_field":"name","slug":"mtl-kings-solo","cover":"https://rs.novelbuddy.me/covers/kings-solo.webp","status":"completed","rating":0,"summary":"The king was killed by someone he loved deeply.hate it?certainly!What if you do it again?There are not so many ifs in the world, but some people are reluctant to let him die.So after that sword strike, he was alive again, how should he repay the pain that man gave him?This is a story of a reborn king being rescued after meeting a system victim ps: main attack, king attack, ending 1vs1, original system victim, torture Hong Lin and the queen Protagonist: Wang Qi┃ Supporting role: Hong Lin, Park Seung-ki, Wang Hong, Wang Ling","stats":{"views":32,"day_views":0,"week_views":2,"month_views":6,"bookmarks_count":0,"comments_count":0,"chapters_count":24,"ratings_count":0,"reviews_count":0},"updated_at":"2026-08-08T03:19:25.000Z","cv":1786159165061,"is_new":false,"is_hot":false,"is_adult":false,"cover_censored":false,"latest_chapters":[{"id":"DLEy6Ja2","url":"/mtl-kings-solo/chapter-24","name":"Chapter 24","slug":"chapter-24","created_at":"2026-08-08T03:19:25.000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-08T03:19:25.000Z","number":24,"cv":1786159165061},{"id":"DkyR7NO8","url":"/mtl-kings-solo/chapter-23","name":"Chapter 23","slug":"chapter-23","created_at":"2026-08-08T03:19:25.000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-08T03:19:25.000Z","number":23,"cv":1786159165061},{"id":"270yRbZ8","url":"/mtl-kings-solo/chapter-22","name":"Chapter 22","slug":"chapter-22","created_at":"2026-08-08T03:19:25.000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-08T03:19:25.000Z","number":22,"cv":1786159165061}],"genres":[{"name":"System","slug":"system"}],"is_published":true,"episode_duration":null,"has_sub":false,"anime_season":null,"ani_id":null,"year_views":32,"is_raw":false,"is_uncensored":false,"is_mtl":true,"has_dub":false,"mal_id":null,"has_dmca":false},{"id":"bDMGn3X8","url":"/mtl-solo-traveler","name":"MTL-solo traveler","alt_names":[{"name":"独行客"}],"alt_name":"独行客","match_field":"name","slug":"mtl-solo-traveler","cover":"https://rs.novelbuddy.me/covers/solo-traveler.webp","status":"completed","rating":0,"summary":"It is probably the story of two people finally untying their knots and making do with their lives.Dao produces one, one produces two, two produces three, three produces all things, and there are all things, and there is life and death.Where there is life and death, there are ghosts.That's why he has the meaning of existence.His existence is to supervise the normal operation of reincarnation life and death.Therefore, the vulgar life of a mortal is beyond his reach.","stats":{"views":0,"day_views":0,"week_views":0,"month_views":0,"bookmarks_count":0,"comments_count":0,"chapters_count":16,"ratings_count":0,"reviews_count":0},"updated_at":"2026-08-02T23:29:11.000Z","cv":1785713351259,"is_new":false,"is_hot":false,"is_adult":false,"cover_censored":false,"latest_chapters":[{"id":"8NXeyqwD","url":"/mtl-solo-traveler/chapter-16","name":"Chapter 16","slug":"chapter-16","created_at":"2026-08-02T23:29:11.000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-02T23:29:11.000Z","number":16,"cv":1785713351259},{"id":"8nXyWRoD","url":"/mtl-solo-traveler/chapter-15","name":"Chapter 15","slug":"chapter-15","created_at":"2026-08-02T23:29:11.000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-02T23:29:11.000Z","number":15,"cv":1785713351259},{"id":"2ZmGNV5D","url":"/mtl-solo-traveler/chapter-14","name":"Chapter 14","slug":"chapter-14","created_at":"2026-08-02T23:29:11.000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-02T23:29:11.000Z","number":14,"cv":1785713351259}],"is_uncensored":false,"is_raw":false,"is_mtl":true,"has_dmca":false,"is_published":true,"has_sub":false,"has_dub":false,"anime_season":null,"episode_duration":null,"mal_id":null,"ani_id":null},{"id":"g8jbra8M","url":"/mtl-solo-leveling","name":"MTL-Solo Leveling","alt_names":[{"name":"我独自升级"},{"name":"Only I Level Up"}],"alt_name":"我独自升级","match_field":"name","slug":"mtl-solo-leveling","cover":"https://rs.novelbuddy.me/covers/solo-leveling.webp","status":"completed","rating":0,"summary":"This novel is also referred to as Only I Level Up. A decade ago, when the \"Gate\" that linked the real world to the monster realm opened, some ordinary individuals gained the ability to hunt monsters within the Gate. They are referred to as \"Hunters\". However, not every Hunter possesses great strength. My name is Sung Jin-Woo, an E-rank Hunter. I am a person who has to put his life on the line in the most menial catacombs, known as the \"World's Weakest\". With no skills to showcase, I barely scraped by financially through battles in low-tier catacombs… until I stumbled upon a hidden catacomb that presented the toughest challenges within the D-rank catacombs! Ultimately, as I faced imminent death, I unexpectedly acquired a peculiar power, a quest log visible only to me, along with a secret method for leveling up that is mine alone! By completing my quests and defeating monsters, my level would increase. Transforming from the weakest Hunter into the mightiest S-rank Hunter!","stats":{"views":552,"day_views":14,"week_views":38,"month_views":50,"bookmarks_count":1,"comments_count":0,"chapters_count":493,"ratings_count":0,"reviews_count":0,"manga_only_comments_count":0},"updated_at":"2026-07-20T08:42:35.000Z","cv":1785686015618,"is_new":false,"is_hot":false,"is_adult":false,"cover_censored":false,"latest_chapters":[{"id":"DVk4Bnm2","url":"/mtl-solo-leveling/chapter-493","name":"Chapter 493:","slug":"chapter-493","created_at":"2026-07-20T08:42:35.000Z","updated_at":"2026-07-20T08:42:35.000Z","number":493,"cv":1785686015618},{"id":"DMvZBgJ2","url":"/mtl-solo-leveling/chapter-492","name":"Chapter 492:","slug":"chapter-492","created_at":"2026-07-20T08:42:35.000Z","updated_at":"2026-07-20T08:42:35.000Z","number":492,"cv":1785686015618},{"id":"81zN479Y","url":"/mtl-solo-leveling/chapter-491","name":"Chapter 491:","slug":"chapter-491","created_at":"2026-07-20T08:42:35.000Z","updated_at":"2026-07-20T08:42:35.000Z","number":491,"cv":1785686015618}],"genres":[{"name":"Action","slug":"action"},{"name":"Adventure","slug":"adventure"},{"name":"Drama","slug":"drama"},{"name":"Fantasy","slug":"fantasy"},{"name":"Mystery","slug":"mystery"},{"name":"Shounen","slug":"shounen"},{"name":"Supernatural","slug":"supernatural"}],"episode_duration":null,"has_sub":false,"anime_season":null,"rating_avg":0,"ani_id":null,"rating_count":0,"year_views":552,"is_raw":false,"is_uncensored":false,"is_mtl":true,"has_dub":false,"mal_id":null,"lists_count":0},{"id":"M2zbLV2A","url":"/solo-leveling-ragnarok","name":"Solo Leveling- Ragnarok","alt_names":[{"name":"나 혼자만 레벨업 : 라그나로크"}],"alt_name":"나 혼자만 레벨업 : 라그나로크","match_field":"name","slug":"solo-leveling-ragnarok","cover":"https://rs.novelbuddy.me/covers/solo-leveling-ragnarok.png","status":"completed","rating":5,"summary":"<p>Sung Su-Ho, who lived as an ordinary college student, at the moment of facing death, awakens his special lineage that was dormant!</p><p>“Awaken.”</p><p>A hunter who defies death and dominates, pay attention to the new level up he presents!</p> <p>……………………………………………………………</p>\n<p>Dear readers! Without any ads, maybe you will prefer .</p>","stats":{"views":63645,"day_views":344,"week_views":1484,"month_views":2459,"bookmarks_count":173,"comments_count":2,"chapters_count":376,"ratings_count":5,"reviews_count":4,"manga_only_comments_count":2},"updated_at":"2026-03-30T21:29:23.000Z","cv":1791450986687,"is_new":false,"is_hot":false,"is_adult":false,"cover_censored":false,"latest_chapters":[{"id":"DVblJovD","url":"/solo-leveling-ragnarok/epilogue","name":"Epilogue","slug":"epilogue","created_at":"2026-03-30T21:29:23.000Z","updated_at":"2026-03-30T21:29:23.000Z","number":376,"cv":1791450986687},{"id":"YORl5EK8","url":"/solo-leveling-ragnarok/chapter-374","name":"Chapter 374","slug":"chapter-374","created_at":"2026-03-30T21:29:23.000Z","updated_at":"2026-03-30T21:29:23.000Z","number":375,"cv":1791450986687},{"id":"DML5OkrY","url":"/solo-leveling-ragnarok/chapter-373","name":"Chapter 373","slug":"chapter-373","created_at":"2026-03-30T21:29:23.000Z","updated_at":"2026-03-30T21:29:23.000Z","number":374,"cv":1791450986687}],"genres":[{"name":"Action","slug":"action"},{"name":"Adventure","slug":"adventure"},{"name":"Fantasy","slug":"fantasy"}],"episode_duration":null,"has_sub":false,"anime_season":null,"rating_avg":5,"ani_id":null,"rating_count":5,"year_views":10132,"is_raw":false,"is_uncensored":false,"is_mtl":false,"has_dub":false,"mal_id":null,"lists_count":2},{"id":"WYXogb8O","url":"/solo-dungeon-runner","name":"Solo Dungeon Runner","match_field":"name","slug":"solo-dungeon-runner","cover":"https://rs.novelbuddy.me/covers/solo-dungeon-runner.png","status":"ongoing","rating":4.5,"summary":"In a world where dungeon runners rise to fame by mastering their classes and conquering impossible threats, Alexander was never meant to be part of it. No class. No path. Just a quiet life.When a mysterious portal drags him into a hidden realm known as his Inner Path, Alexander unlocks a class no one has seen before: Beholder. There’s no fanfare. No guidance. Only eyes that see too much, and power that threatens to unravel his mind with every use.Now, trapped in an abyssal dungeon that reshapes itself around eldritch laws, Alexander must survive alone.But with each victory, his vision sharpens. His spells twist reality. And the deeper he goes, the more the world outside should start to worry.Because when he returns-They won’t be able to look away.","stats":{"views":830,"day_views":0,"week_views":0,"month_views":2,"bookmarks_count":12,"comments_count":0,"chapters_count":84,"ratings_count":0,"reviews_count":0},"updated_at":"2026-03-19T09:24:50.000Z","cv":1773912290000,"is_new":false,"is_hot":false,"is_adult":false,"cover_censored":false,"latest_chapters":[{"id":"DVbMdQmD","url":"/solo-dungeon-runner/chapter-84-streak","name":"Chapter 84: [ Streak ]","slug":"chapter-84-streak","created_at":"2026-03-19T09:24:50.000Z","updated_at":"2026-03-19T09:24:50.000Z","number":84,"cv":1773912290000},{"id":"DxKj9bkY","url":"/solo-dungeon-runner/chapter-83-tricks","name":"Chapter 83: [ Tricks ]","slug":"chapter-83-tricks","created_at":"2026-03-19T09:24:50.000Z","updated_at":"2026-03-19T09:24:50.000Z","number":83,"cv":1773